    "result_text": "The full test suite passes. \n\n## Summary\n\nThe change adds a `displayName` field formatted as `LastName, FirstName` to owner responses, touching two files:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `displayName` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a single `@Mapping` expression on the existing `toOwnerDto` method to compute `owner.getLastName() + \", \" + owner.getFirstName()`.\n\nBoth the `POST /api/owners` (create) responder and the `GET /api/owners/{id}` responder route through `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto`, so the derived name appears consistently without adding any new function classes or endpoint pipeline steps.\n\nStructural impact was kept minimal: no growth to any complex method or class \u2014 the only code change is one MapStruct annotation on an abstract, zero-complexity interface method (low `WMC_other`, `CC` 1), plus a declarative schema addition. `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0 \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS`.",
